      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Set up this workflow\nConfigure the HTTPS API origin, spreadsheet ID and credentials on the source, Reach Dog HTTP Request, and Google Sheets nodes. Create the tabs and columns described in the README. Start the workflow manually. Open the waiting execution's resume form, inspect the amount and choose Approve or Reject. The form expires after fifteen minutes. Keep the same run label when recovering an interrupted execution. Each unchanged request retains its idempotency key, and each completed product updates its existing sheet row. Change the run label only when you intend to purchase fresh results. Inspect the Excluded tab for records that need corrections.",
